  "name": "pdh-cook_islands_population_grid_2020",
  "notes": "Population Raster Cook Islands 2020\r\nData Input: Settlement footprint from Facebook's High-Resolution Population Density Maps https://data.humdata.org/dataset/cook-islands-high-resolution-population-density-maps-demographic-estimates\r\nPopulation allocated proportionally using 2011 census population counts at enumeration area level.\r\nYear Population Growth Rate of 0.23% has been applied to update population up to 2020\r\nThe human settlement footprint with census population allocated has been converted into a 100 m resolution raster.\r\n\n\n_Access this dataset from the [Pacific Data Hub](https://pacificdata.org/data/dataset/cok_population_grid_2020)_",
